  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f22f57d0cf5c493280a0ab6b7dbaea9e3fc5b035c6d410d59c2f476043bd03a8.png] \n\nGiven expression: 33 + 4 × 21 ÷ 3 − 17 = 122\n\nInterchanging the two signs and using BODMAS rule we get,\n\n1. ÷ and −\n\n33 + 4 × 21 − **3**** ÷ 17 **= 122\n\n33 +** 4 ****×**** 21** - 0.176 = 122\n\n**33 + 84** - 0.176 = 122\n\n132 - 0.176 = 122\n\n131.8 ≠ 122\n\n2. + and −\n\n33 - 4 × **21 ****÷ ****3** + 17 = 122\n\n33 - **4 ****× 7 **+ 17 = 122\n\n**33** - 28 **+ 17** = 122\n\n50 - 28 = 122\n\n22 ≠ 122\n\n**3. + and ×**\n\n33 × 4 + **21 ****÷ ****3** − 17 = 122\n\n**33 ****× 4 **+ 7 − 17 = 122\n\n**132 ****+ 7 **− 17 = 122\n\n139 − 17 = 122\n\n**122 = 122**\n\n4. − and ×\n\n33 + 4 - **21 ****÷ 3 **× 17 = 122\n\n33 + 4 - **7 ×**** 17** = 122\n\n**33 + 4** - 119 = 122\n\n37 - 119 = 122\n\n-82 ≠ 122\n\nHence, the **correct answer **is **\" + and × \".**",
